<title>USA: USDA signs PL480 pact with Sri Lanka for wheat.</title>
<headline>USDA signs PL480 pact with Sri Lanka for wheat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it signed a Public Law 480, Title I, sales agreement with Sri Lanka to provide $10 million for the purchase of about 55,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</p>
<p>USDA said the supply period is fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
